! Changelog

!! v0.2.1

* '''Requires the next TidGi Desktop release''' that ships `window.service.wiki.getTiddlerRoutingInfo`. Older TidGi builds will keep the feature unavailable.
* Fetch routing info on toolbar button hover only (no request on every render)
* Drive the button UI with conditional shortcut syntax (`<%if%>`) instead of nested `$list`
* Startup only probes feature availability; per-tiddler chains stay hover-driven

!! v0.2.0

* Use TidGi `getTiddlerRoutingInfo` instead of reimplementing routing in the plugin (needs a TidGi build that exposes this API)
* Enable the feature only when at least one sub-wiki has routing settings
* Keep UI in wikitext; JS only refreshes temp routing-info tiddlers

!! v0.1.0

* Initial release: TidGi-only ViewToolbar indicator with highest-priority routing chain tooltip
* i18n: en-GB / zh-Hans
* Click toggles the configured private tag (default `私有`)
